1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,974
This year I invested in chip
stocks and lost 250,000,000 won,

2
00:00:03,974 --> 00:00:05,540
70% of everything I owned.

3
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:08,621
The day KOSPI, Korea's main
index, first passed 9,000,

4
00:00:08,621 --> 00:00:10,921
everyone was earning,
so I borrowed to invest.

5
00:00:11,301 --> 00:00:13,868
The July crash force-sold
the borrowed money,

6
00:00:13,868 --> 00:00:15,979
leaving me just over 100,000,000 won.

7
00:00:16,358 --> 00:00:20,113
My job is shaky, and my daughter's
tutoring academy fees come monthly.

8
00:00:20,493 --> 00:00:22,173
My wife still doesn't know.

9
00:00:22,553 --> 00:00:25,412
I was about to delete my stock
app when a thought hit me.

10
00:00:25,792 --> 00:00:29,632
If I leave now, this 250,000,000
won becomes money lost forever.

11
00:00:30,012 --> 00:00:33,736
If I don't give up and start again,
can I get my lost money back?

12
00:00:34,116 --> 00:00:37,286
The five methods I found
are in the video below.
